# Refrain
East side, West side, all a-round the town, The
D5(3) B4(3) A4(3) G4(3) G4(2) G4 E4(2) F#4 G4(3) ~G4(2) G4
tots sang "Ring-a-ros-ie," "Lon-don Bridge is fall-ing down."
G4(2) G4 A4 ~G4 E4 D4 G4(2) C5(2) B4 B4 A4(2) A4(2) E4 A4(3) ~A4(3)
Boys and girls to-geth-er, me and Ma-mie O'-Rourke,
B4(2) D5 A4(2) B4 G4 B4(2) ~B4(3) G4(2) G4 A4 G4 E4 G4(3) ~G4(2) r
tripped the light fan-tas-tic on the side-walks of New York.
G4(2) G4 A4 ~G4 E4 D4 G4(2) C5(2) B4 B4 A4(2) E4(2) F#4 G4(3) r(3)

